  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Tiamat cargo manifest (amended 2181)
  body: 'TIAMAT RETURN CARGO: AMENDED FOR MERIDIAN (CREWED) 2181


    ITEM 7: Sealed sample canister, cryogenic, biological rated.

    CONSIGNEE: Cdr. D. R. Ashford, Meridian.

    AUTHORITY: Command Directive 7.


    Directive 7: locate the source of FEATURE 7 and return a viable biological sample to Earth.

    Crew are not to be briefed. If the source responds to stimulus, continue. Response is not hostility.'
  setsFlag: read_manifest
